# Solving a puzzle with one check and one reveal, then what stays after a restart.
expect Crossword
tap-id puzzle-3
tap-id cell-1
type put
tap Enter
tap-id cell-5
type minor
tap Enter
tap-id cell-10
type alike
tap Enter
tap-id cell-15
type noted
tap Enter
tap-id game-more
tap Check word
expect This word is correct.
tap Back to puzzle
# A revealed square counts, and the last two letters finish the grid.
tap-id cell-21
tap-id 4294967295
tap-id game-more
tap Reveal square
tap Reveal
tap-id cell-22
type e
tap Enter
expect Letter or whole word
type n
tap Enter
expect Puzzle complete · 1 check · 1 reveal
expect Undo
expect Rules
clean
shot crossword-completed
# The shelf marks it Completed.
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
expect Completed
expect-missing 21/21 squares
clean
shot crossword-completed-shelf
# New game skips to the next puzzle nobody has started.
tap-id puzzle-3
tap-id game-more
tap New game
expect Small beginnings
# A solved puzzle stays solved after the app is closed and opened again.
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
restart
wait-for Small beginnings
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
expect Completed
tap-id puzzle-3
expect Puzzle complete · 1 check · 1 reveal
# Restart clears its letters, and it stays marked Completed.
tap-id game-more
tap Restart puzzle
tap Restart
expect 8 Across: Fingers on two hands
expect-missing Puzzle complete
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
expect Completed
clean
shot crossword-restarted-still-completed
